{
  "nl_statement": "Show that $\\sin (\\pi / 12)$ is an algebraic number.",
  "nl_proof": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n    \\sin \\pi/12=\\sin \\left(\\pi/4-\\pi/6\\right) & =\\sin \\pi/4 \\cos \\pi/6-\\cos \\pi/4 \\sin \\pi/6 \\\\\n& =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2 \\sqrt{2}}-\\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{2}} \\\\\n& =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{2 \\sqrt{2}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
}
